for using a selfie stick, and she is the lucky one.

352
00:16:48,260 --> 00:16:50,360
安吉  黄泉路上好走
Angie, God rest your soul,

353
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,180
把你的爪子从我男人身上拿开
get your hands off my boyfriend.

354
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:55,100
麦克斯  你来干嘛
Max, what're you doing here?

355
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:56,640
请你告诉我那是假发
Please tell me that's a wig.

356
00:16:57,980 --> 00:16:59,900
她骗你来这里陪她
She tricked you into coming here.

357
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,900
她才不是披萨店的话事人
She is not in charge of the pizza place.

358
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:04,520
她弟弟才是  这是我的真发
Her brother is. This is my hair.

359
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:07,280
安吉  这是真的吗
Angie, is that true?

360
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,560
所以我白跳了滑步舞吗
Did I do the Electric Slide for nothing?

361
00:17:10,060 --> 00:17:11,240
也不能算白跳
Well, not for nothing.

362
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:13,260
我们赢了跳舞大赛第二名呢
We came in second in the dance competition.

363
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:16,660
好吧  是真的
Okay, fine, it's true.

364
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:18,700
安吉洛才是话事人
Angelo's in charge.

365
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:21,080
我爸爸觉得他才是聪明的那个孩子
My father thought he was the smarter one

366
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,180
因为小时候他戴眼镜
because he wore glasses as a kid.

367
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,820
兰迪  你一切还好吗
Randy, are you okay?

368
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:28,740
这个坏女人有没有乱摸你的"好地方"
Did the bad lady touch you in any of the good places?

369
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:32,000
对不起我说谎了
Look, I'm sorry I lied,

370
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:35,040
但不管怎么说  这是我最开心的一晚
but for what it's worth, I'm having the night of my life.

371
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:38,000
其实我高中时候并不受欢迎
Believe it or not, I wasn't popular in high school.

372
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:40,040
没跟球队的人约过会
I didn't date a football player

373
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,080
也没被搞大过肚子
or get pregnant.

374
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:45,100
我只想人生中当一次人生赢家
For once, I just wanted to show up a winner.

375
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:48,120
-安吉  -惨了
-Hey, Ange! -Oh, no.

376
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:49,600
是米雪儿·帕斯古奇
Here comes Michelle Pascucci.

377
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,940
求你们了  别揭穿我
Please, don't ruin this for me.

378
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:53,790
这谁啊  安吉吉
Who's this, Ange?

379
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:56,320
这紧紧抱着你未婚夫  好像他是
What's she doing holding on to your fiance

380
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:59,200
葬礼守夜时最后一份吃的女人是谁
like he's the last cannoli at a wake?

381
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,900
忘了告诉你  我订婚了
Forgot to tell you, I got engaged.

382
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:05,680
等等
Wait.

383
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:08,580
他不会其实不是你男友吧
Unless that's not really your boyfriend.

384
00:18:10,241 --> 00:18:11,480
因为...  大家都知道你是说谎精
'Cause, uh, you're known to lie.

385
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:15,160
其实呢...
Well...

386
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,820
她没说谎
she's not lying.

387
00:18:17,340 --> 00:18:20,300
他出轨跟她在一起已经好几年了
He's been cheating on me with her for years.

388
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,440
我有一次在意大利餐厅里抓到他们
I, uh, caught 'em at the Olive Garden.

389
00:18:25,780 --> 00:18:27,120
感觉[闻到]是撕逼的时候了
I smell a catfight,

390
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,341
还有男人香水味
and Drakkar Noir.

391
00:18:30,341 --> 00:18:34,233
撕逼大战啦
Catfight!

392
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:35,020
臭三八  你过来
Oh, come here, bitch.

393
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,900
-听我指挥  -好的  小心点
- Just follow my lead. - Okay, careful.

394
00:18:39,020 --> 00:18:40,840
我头发花了65块弄的
I spent $65 on my hair.

395
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:42,900
我本来计划让这发型撑一周的
I was hoping not to touch it till next week.

396
00:18:44,340 --> 00:18:46,560
死三八  别碰我手臂
Don't touch my arm, bitch!

397
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:50,360
我不该碰你手臂吗
Oh, I shouldn't touch your arm?

398
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:53,480
那你别碰我男人啊
Maybe you shouldn't touch my guy.

399
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:58,240
这个派对终于开始精彩了
Finally, this party's getting good.

400
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,320
推我
Push me back.

401
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:04,360
你刚才推我了是吧
Did you just push me?

402
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:07,500
就推你了
Yeah, I pushed you,

403
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,380
但推你再大力  也没你男人
but not as hard as your boyfriend

404
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:13,280
在车子后座"推"我时大力啊
was pushing me in the back of the car.

405
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:16,620
你找死  贱逼
Oh, hell no, bitch!

406
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:21,700
我说了让你别碰我头发
I told you not to touch my hair!

407
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:25,180
天啊
Oh, my God!

408
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:27,100
她居然有刀
She's got a freakin' knife!

409
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:30,400
好  我不打了
All right, I'm out,

410
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:32,000
但我饶过你
but only because...

411
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,820
是因为我在假释期
I'm on parole

412
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:37,140
我上次在地铁上把一个女人的刘海给扯下来了
for pulling out a woman's bangs on the F Train.

413
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,920
我们走吧  安吉
Let's get out of here, Ange.

414
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,780
我的发型乱了吗
Is my hair dented?

415
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:44,840
亲爱的  我来搞定  我包里有筷子
I'll fix it, hun. I got a chopstick in my purse.

416
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,740
过来  你个刚被人用完的二手货
Get over here, you sloppy second.

417
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:54,320
我有点喜欢我也有个穿着闪亮铠...
I kind of like having a knight in shining--

418
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,440
这是什么  铝箔纸吗
what is this, aluminum foil?

419
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,940
它帮我热着我胸罩里的意大利水饺呢
Well, it is warming up the ravioli I put in my bra.

420
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:04,240
麦克斯  能跟我跳这支舞吗
Max, can I have this dance?

421
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:11,420
你觉得我们高中时  我们会好上吗
So you think you and I would have dated in high school?

422
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,040
我读高中时
Well, when I was in high school,

423
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:14,820
你已经30多岁了
you were in your 30s,

424
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:15,640
所以...
so...

425
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:17,220
会吧  听起来合理
yeah, that sounds right.

426
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:21,680
我刚才说服了安吉洛租后办公室给我们
I just convinced Angelo to let us rent the back office.

427
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,280
虽然我得当他的伴  陪他去看车展
I mean, I may have to be his date to the Auto Show.

428
00:20:24,900 --> 00:20:26,260
穿好一点
Wear something nice.

429
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:27,680
比如丝质上衣
Like a silk blouse

430
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:29,400
或者比基尼
or a bikini.

431
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,580
他想在众人面前显摆我
He wants to show me off.

432
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,181
我从来没来过这样的场合
I never went to anything like this.

433
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,160
同学会  舞会
A reunion or a prom

434
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,300
或者是班级
or a class.

435
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,420
在这些场合应该干嘛
What do you do at these things?
